<h3>Serves</h3><ul><li><b>REQ-2</b> When an authenticated staff user requests the overdue list, the Invoice Reminders API shall return every invoice currently classified as overdue, each with invoice ID, invoice number, customer name, amount, due date and days overdue (calendar days since the due date).</li><li><b>REQ-3</b> When the overdue list is requested with a customer filter, the Invoice Reminders API shall return only the overdue invoices that belong to that customer.</li><li><b>REQ-4</b> When the overdue list is requested with a days-overdue bucket filter, the Invoice Reminders API shall return only overdue invoices whose days overdue fall inside the named fixed bucket (7–30, 31–60 or 61+, limits inclusive, not shifted by the configured overdue threshold), or respond 400 with a validation error when the bucket value is not one of these.</li></ul>
